   The limiting-space primary/white chromaticity table (rec709 / rec2020 /
   p3d65 / p3d60 / p3dci / proPhoto / adobeRGB) is the public
   specification facts of those spaces (ITU-R BT.709/BT.2020, DCI P3 +
   SMPTE RP 431-2, ISO 22028 ROMM, Adobe RGB (1998)) — data, transcribed
   with per-row source comments. The Alcedo Studio aces_reference_gamut_
   compression.h (GPL-3.0) was consulted READ-ONLY to cross-check the RGC
   shape; zero GPL code or text copied.
